@startuml

title AEB Extensibility

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

class AEB {
    - behaviorMappingMethod : EmpathicBehaviorMappingMethod
    - mappingParameters : dict

    + AEB(behaviorMappingMethod : EmpathicBehaviorMappingMethod, mappingParameters : dict)
    + processRobotAffectiveState(robotAffectiveState : dict)
    + publishBehaviorParameters(behaviorParameters : dict)
}

abstract class EmpathicBehaviorMappingMethod {
    {abstract} + map(robotAffectiveState : dict, parameters : dict) : dict
}

AEB --> EmpathicBehaviorMappingMethod : uses

note right of EmpathicBehaviorMappingMethod
Extension point for mapping
the robot affective state to
structured empathic behavior
parameters.

p = f_EB(s_r, theta_EB)
end note

note bottom of AEB
Receives the robot affective state,
applies the configured mapping method,
and publishes the resulting structured
empathic behavior parameters.
end note

@enduml